1. `AGENTS.md` — single source of truth (rules, stack, repo map, golden rules + NEVER list).
2. The memory bank, per `docs/process/ai-session-protocol.md` §Start of session.

Skills live in `skills/` (see `AGENTS.md` §8). **Always on — follow in every
response:** `skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` (write the least code that works) and
